      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The authors report the observation of 19 patients suffering from cruralgia, who have undergone a tomodensitometric examination. A foraminal hernia was revealed in 13 patients. Four other patients presented an arthrositic or hyperostositic foraminal stenosis. Only one patient was operated upon."},
